  },
  "_note": "Map ids: camerino is the start, camerino-1..10 the post-floor Camerino (same ambience), planta-1..10 the ten floors, two per biome (planta-1/2 Castro Sumergido, 3/4 Hipermercado, 5/6 Verbena, 7/8 Balneario, 9/10 Plato), each pair sharing its biome's ambience; prueba-castro is the hand-made test map (planta-1's ambience). Boss fights (jefe-* in combatStarted.order) get their own theme via `combatMusicByEntity`: jefe-centollo/-encargada/-giganton/-socorrista share a generic boss track, jefe-presentador (the finale) its own. Stings (scripts/audio/build-willy-stings.mjs builds them by layering existing CC0 sfx): clockWarning (pct 50/25 = two dings, 10 = urgent triple + buzzer), roomCollapsing (fase grieta = crack, caida = collapse), boxOpened (rarezaMax bronce/plata = chest + ding, oro/legendaria = arpeggio + applause), achievementUnlocked, bossPhase, trapdoorOpened, rivalEncountered. `conditionApplied`/condition `eliminado` is willy's one-hit elimination (the ELIMINADO vanish) and plays the `eliminated` sting; `natural` on attackRolled is the raw d20 (1 = pifia/fumble)."
}
